{
    "title": "pixiv\u30b3\u30df\u30c3\u30af - \u307f\u3093\u306a\u306e\u30de\u30f3\u30ac\u30a2\u30d7\u30ea",
    "description": "\uff3c This is the amazing thing about pixiv comics \uff0f\r\n\u25cf More than 4000 comics can be read. You can read more popular manga than any other manga app!\r\n\u25cf No limits, no tickets, no points! Unlimited reading!\r\n\u25cfThis is the only place where you can read the latest episodes of \"It's hard to fall in love with an otaku\" which will be made into an anime, and \"Uramichi Oniisan\" and \"Sachiiro no One Room\" which are hot topics on SNS!\r\n\u25cf There are more than 350 pixiv comic limited works and newly written limited episodes.\r\n\u25cf Our editorial department carefully selects 1,200 original manga posted daily on pixiv, the world's largest illustration SNS. Future hits are born here!\r\n\r\n\uff3c I want to know more about pixiv comics \uff0f\r\nThis is the official manga app of \"pixiv\", the world's largest illustration and manga posting site used by 30 million people.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 The number of published works is the largest in Japan. Anyway, there are many comics that can be read!\r\nMore than 4000 works are posted, and more than 400 works are updated monthly! A lot of popular manga!\r\nYou can enjoy popular works serialized in Jump and magazines, comicalizations of popular games such as \"Fate\" and \"Idolmaster\", and topical works such as \"Hibiki\", which was also made into a movie.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 TV commercial now airing\u266a Click here for popular works that can only be read on pixiv Comic!\r\n\uff65:*+. \"This manga is amazing!\" 2016 \u300fWoman edition 1st place! .:+\r\n\"It's hard to fall in love with an otaku\"\r\n\r\n\uff65:*+. \"Web Manga General Election\" 1st place in the indie category \u30fb 3rd \"Next Coming Manga Award\" 1st place in the web manga category! .:+\r\n\"Uramichi Onii-san\"\r\n\r\n\uff65:*+. Unusual reprint! A topical work that has already sold over 560,000 copies.:+\r\n\"Sachiiro no One Room\"\r\n\r\npixiv Comic is the only app where you can read the latest stories!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Works recommended by the editorial department are updated daily!\r\nOnly interesting works are carefully selected from over 5.5 million posted comics,\r\nDelivered daily with a word from the editorial department!\r\nYou can read manga in a wide range of genres every day, such as shounen manga for men, girl manga for women, classic romance, romantic comedy, original BL, 4-frame comics, gags, fantasy, school comics, true story essays, and touching stories.\r\nA new hit may be born from here...!?\r\n\r\n\u25a0 No limits & no points! You can read as much as you like\u266a\r\nIt is an application that allows you to read manga as much as you like without stress.\r\nNo more waiting for points or buying tickets!\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Easy to read without logging in!\r\nIf you just want to read pixiv comics, you can easily enjoy them without logging in.\r\nFor even more fun, if you log in with your pixiv account, you can \"Like\" the works and \"Follow\" the creators.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 You can directly support the author of the posted manga work!\r\nBy sending \"Like\" to the work and \"Following\" the author,\r\nBe the first to know about new updates and posts.\r\nYou can also send supportive comments directly to the authors of your favorite works.\r\n\r\n\uff3c In times like this, pixiv comics are recommended \uff0f\r\n\"I want to cry as hard as I can!\"\r\n=> You can read manga that makes you cry, such as emotional essay manga and hot-blooded youth manga!\r\n\"I want to kill time during my commute and breaks\"\r\n=> With just one smartphone, read 4-panel comics and short stories with pixiv Comic, an all-you-can-read e-book app anytime, anywhere!\r\n\"I feel like I want to squeak\u2661\"\r\n=> We recommend heart-pounding romance manga, school girls' manga, youth manga about romance for adults, and lady comics!\r\n\"New Year holidays, summer vacation, spring vacation, too much free time...\"\r\n=>pixiv Comic is an all-you-can-read app with no limits, no tickets, and no points! Try and read a wide variety of genres!\r\n\"I'm bored every day. I want stimulation!\"\r\n=> Kill time with exciting action manga, battle manga, and horror manga that never stops fear\u2606\r\n\"I want to read all volumes together, up to the latest issue\"\r\n=> You can also purchase comics on pixiv Comic! Buy it all at once and read it quickly!\r\n\"I'm stressed every day...\"\r\n=> Laugh as hard as you can with gag manga! Relieve stress with funny stories and romantic comics!\r\n\"I'm tired of reading manga.\"\r\n=> pixiv Comic has a lot of original manga! Why don't you read dark fantasy, manga with monsters, or manga that you don't usually read?\r\n\"I don't have time to go to the bookstore...\"\r\n=> With e-books, you can read while lounging around at home! Enjoy an assortment of books that puts bookstores to shame, from men's to women's!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\uff3c This is the amazing thing about pixiv comics \uff0f<br>\u25cf More than 4000 comics can be read. You can read more popular manga than any other manga app!<br>\u25cf No limits, no tickets, no points! Unlimited reading!<br>\u25cfThis is the only place where you can read the latest episodes of &quot;It&#39;s hard to fall in love with an otaku&quot; which will be made into an anime, and &quot;Uramichi Oniisan&quot; and &quot;Sachiiro no One Room&quot; which are hot topics on SNS!<br>\u25cf There are more than 350 pixiv comic limited works and newly written limited episodes.<br>\u25cf Our editorial department carefully selects 1,200 original manga posted daily on pixiv, the world&#39;s largest illustration SNS. Future hits are born here!<br><br>\uff3c I want to know more about pixiv comics \uff0f<br>This is the official manga app of &quot;pixiv&quot;, the world&#39;s largest illustration and manga posting site used by 30 million people.<br><br>\u25a0 The number of published works is the largest in Japan. Anyway, there are many comics that can be read!<br>More than 4000 works are posted, and more than 400 works are updated monthly! A lot of popular manga!<br>You can enjoy popular works serialized in Jump and magazines, comicalizations of popular games such as &quot;Fate&quot; and &quot;Idolmaster&quot;, and topical works such as &quot;Hibiki&quot;, which was also made into a movie.<br><br>\u25a0 TV commercial now airing\u266a Click here for popular works that can only be read on pixiv Comic!<br>\uff65:*+. &quot;This manga is amazing!&quot; 2016 \u300fWoman edition 1st place! .:+<br>&quot;It&#39;s hard to fall in love with an otaku&quot;<br><br>\uff65:*+. &quot;Web Manga General Election&quot; 1st place in the indie category \u30fb 3rd &quot;Next Coming Manga Award&quot; 1st place in the web manga category! .:+<br>&quot;Uramichi Onii-san&quot;<br><br>\uff65:*+. Unusual reprint! A topical work that has already sold over 560,000 copies.:+<br>&quot;Sachiiro no One Room&quot;<br><br>pixiv Comic is the only app where you can read the latest stories!<br><br>\u25a0 Works recommended by the editorial department are updated daily!<br>Only interesting works are carefully selected from over 5.5 million posted comics,<br>Delivered daily with a word from the editorial department!<br>You can read manga in a wide range of genres every day, such as shounen manga for men, girl manga for women, classic romance, romantic comedy, original BL, 4-frame comics, gags, fantasy, school comics, true story essays, and touching stories.<br>A new hit may be born from here...!?<br><br>\u25a0 No limits &amp; no points! You can read as much as you like\u266a<br>It is an application that allows you to read manga as much as you like without stress.<br>No more waiting for points or buying tickets!<br><br>\u25a0 Easy to read without logging in!<br>If you just want to read pixiv comics, you can easily enjoy them without logging in.<br>For even more fun, if you log in with your pixiv account, you can &quot;Like&quot; the works and &quot;Follow&quot; the creators.<br><br>\u25a0 You can directly support the author of the posted manga work!<br>By sending &quot;Like&quot; to the work and &quot;Following&quot; the author,<br>Be the first to know about new updates and posts.<br>You can also send supportive comments directly to the authors of your favorite works.<br><br>\uff3c In times like this, pixiv comics are recommended \uff0f<br>&quot;I want to cry as hard as I can!&quot;<br>=&gt; You can read manga that makes you cry, such as emotional essay manga and hot-blooded youth manga!<br>&quot;I want to kill time during my commute and breaks&quot;<br>=&gt; With just one smartphone, read 4-panel comics and short stories with pixiv Comic, an all-you-can-read e-book app anytime, anywhere!<br>&quot;I feel like I want to squeak\u2661&quot;<br>=&gt; We recommend heart-pounding romance manga, school girls&#39; manga, youth manga about romance for adults, and lady comics!<br>&quot;New Year holidays, summer vacation, spring vacation, too much free time...&quot;<br>=&gt;pixiv Comic is an all-you-can-read app with no limits, no tickets, and no points! Try and read a wide variety of genres!<br>&quot;I&#39;m bored every day. I want stimulation!&quot;<br>=&gt; Kill time with exciting action manga, battle manga, and horror manga that never stops fear\u2606<br>&quot;I want to read all volumes together, up to the latest issue&quot;<br>=&gt; You can also purchase comics on pixiv Comic! Buy it all at once and read it quickly!<br>&quot;I&#39;m stressed every day...&quot;<br>=&gt; Laugh as hard as you can with gag manga! Relieve stress with funny stories and romantic comics!<br>&quot;I&#39;m tired of reading manga.&quot;<br>=&gt; pixiv Comic has a lot of original manga! Why don&#39;t you read dark fantasy, manga with monsters, or manga that you don&#39;t usually read?<br>&quot;I don&#39;t have time to go to the bookstore...&quot;<br>=&gt; With e-books, you can read while lounging around at home! Enjoy an assortment of books that puts bookstores to shame, from men&#39;s to women&#39;s!",
    "summary": "\uff3c Readable manga is the largest in Japan \uff0f\nPixiv Comic is a free manga app that allows you to read unlimited manga.\nNot only the popular manga that is the topic, but also the original manga that can only be read here!",
